# Local Qdrant database — binary segment/index files containing ingested enterprise content.
# Never belongs in Git: huge binary churn, merge conflicts, and it puts real SharePoint data
# (task text, meeting transcripts) into repository history.
.local/qdrant/storage/
# Downloaded Qdrant binary + archive (~93MB), reproducible from the official release.
.local/qdrant/qdrant
.local/qdrant/qdrant.tar.gz
